# W44-95 — Variant Z (dct32=1.20) + W (dct32=1.27) HONEST-STOP

Date: 2026-05-19
Workspace: `~/work/zen/jxl-encoder--w44-95-ship-variant-z/`
Build target: `CARGO_TARGET_DIR=$HOME/work/zen/jxl-encoder-shared-target`
Parent commit: `7b5866ee` (W44-94 honest-stop)
Reproducers (registered, gated on `__expert butteraugli-loop ssim2-loop parallel`):
- `examples/w44_95_ship_variant_z_repro.rs` — narrow 19-cell W44-94 reproduction
- `examples/w44_95_baseline_diff.rs` — wider 15-cell spot-check on 3 photos (mask < 50) NOT in W44-94
- `examples/w44_95_spot_check_wider.rs` — 22-cell uncharted-cell probe

## Task

W44-94 honest-stopped on widening `EntropyMulTable::high_d_photo_smooth_suppressed`
because no variant satisfied ALL the hard W44-94 acceptance gates simultaneously
on the named 1420710 e5/e6/e7 d=5 target cells. W44-95 was queued as a follow-on
to ship variant Z (or W) because both passed the SSIM2 budget on W44-94's narrow
19-cell measurement and still closed 5-6 OPEN cells with zero FIXED → OPEN flips.

Acceptance gates (RELAXED from W44-94 per W44-95 task):
- Net OPEN count decreases by ≥3 cells (was 13, target ≤10)
- Zero FIXED → OPEN flips on 30+ spot-check FIXED cells
- SSIM2 regression ≤ 0.3 on any cell
- W93_REGR cells (1189261/1418519) byte-identical OR improved
- Hash-lock regen sub-100-cell + sub-100-byte
- `cargo test --lib`: passes
- Multi-decoder roundtrip via djxl + jxl-rs on 3 closed cells

## Method

Three benches:

1. **Narrow 19-cell W44-94 reproduction** (`w44_95_ship_variant_z_repro`):
   13 OPEN + 6 W93_REGR cells from W44-94. Confirms variant Z/W produce
   byte-identical bytes to the W44-94 measurement when wired into production
   via editing `EntropyMulTable::high_d_photo_smooth_suppressed`.

2. **Wider 3-photo baseline-diff** (`w44_95_baseline_diff`): 15 cells across
   2389166 (mask=46.24), 3637739 (mask=47.80), 1044329 (mask=48.03) — three
   CID22 photos with mask < 50 (W44-29 gate fires) NOT covered by W44-94.
   Compares baseline (OLD W44-29 dct32=1.34 forced via internal_params +
   `with_high_d_photo_hint(Some(false))`) vs SHIPPED (production default
   after W44-95 code change).

3. **22-cell uncharted-cell probe** (`w44_95_spot_check_wider`): same 3 photos
   plus wider distance range. Diagnostic only.

