## DO NOT

- Re-attempt blind widening of `high_d_photo_smooth_suppressed.dct32x32`
  without a per-image discriminator — measurement is conclusive that no
  global value between 1.20 and 1.34 satisfies all 4 mask<50 photos
  (1420710 + 1531677 wins; 2389166 + 3637739 regress).
- Apply the dct16x32 lift to 1.40 — W44-94 already RULED OUT (1531677
  SSIM2 -0.30 to -0.74).
- Widen the W44-29 gate distance further below 3.0 — W44-78 already
  widened from 4.0 to 3.0; lower than that hits more photos.
- Cite "FMA precision" as the residual mechanism (per user's W44-66
  correction on `fd_residual_not_fma_precision_2026-05-19.md`).
- Touch other repos.
